  "reviewedBoundaries": [
    "MessageContent instantiates media only after its current explicit user expansion; loaded-text search expansion has no media authority. Existing inert MIME/base64 admission stays unchanged; remote and active-format attachments never become media src.",
    "Retry replaces only the same admitted bytes, requires a live connected current element/attempt, ignores retired errors, and preserves local keyboard focus. Audio retains native controls/preload none/no autoplay.",
    "Owned detach pauses and clears only its own audio src. Same-node StrictMode ref replay restores only the exact already-admitted source, closing the prior independently identified private-draft defect.",
    "CSP structural comparison proves the only config change is media-src self data. Existing same-origin default is preserved, data audio is allowed, remote/blob media is not newly allowed; all other directives and config fields are unchanged.",
    "Stricter historical user-image validation and existing source/body order are unchanged."
  ],
